  "sentences": [
    {"text": "The long, narrow corridor stretched ahead of her, lit by a single bulb.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A cold, draughty passageway led to the kitchens.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "At the top of the stairs, the corridor branched to the left and right.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The dark, windowless passage ended in a blank wall.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Slow, measured footsteps echoed along the corridor and grew steadily louder.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The polished, wooden floor squeaked with every step, betraying her.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "When the bell rang, pupils poured out of the classrooms and filled the clamorous, crowded corridor.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "They jostled and shoved past the dented, metal lockers.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Harsh, fluorescent lights flickered overhead.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The last bulb buzzed and went out.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Nurses hurried past without a glance, their shoes squeaking.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "He crept along the wall, keeping to the shadows.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A door slammed somewhere far away.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Rows of identical doors lined both sides, each as blank as the last.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Something pale vanished around the corner just as she looked up.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "They turned left, then right, and were soon lost in the bewildering maze of passages.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A radiator hummed in the silence of the hushed, deserted hallway.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "The passage narrowed and sloped downwards, and he had to duck beneath the low, curved ceiling.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Sunlight from the tall, arched windows streamed across the floor.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "She wandered the interminable, empty corridors for hours without meeting a soul.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "The bare, whitewashed walls were scuffed by years of passing trolleys.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The stuffy, airless corridor smelled of floor polish and boiled cabbage.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A worn, crimson carpet muffled their footsteps.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Vibrant, crowded noticeboards covered the wall outside the staffroom.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "After school the corridors were calm and quiet, and the only sound was the caretaker's broom.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Soft lamps glowed along the passage, and thick carpet hushed every step.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The fire door flew open, and the wind howled down the corridor, tearing posters from the walls.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Every door was closed, and every room behind it was empty.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
